@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Successful payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-payment-001

{"amount":100.00,"currency":"INR","merchantReference":"order-1001","customerId":"customer-7","paymentToken":"tok_visa_success"}

### Get a payment (replace ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}

### Refund (replace ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/refunds
Idempotency-Key: demo-refund-001
